The train slowly left the city.
At first, there were only tall buildings everywhere.
Soon, the loud noises of the city faded.
Then, the journey was very quiet.
I sat in my own seat and looked outside.
After some time, the scenery outside changed.
The train crossed a very long bridge.
I saw a wide river under the bridge.
The water shone brightly in the morning sun.
There were green trees on both sides of the track.
They were very dense trees.
I saw the water flashing brightly through those trees.
It was a very beautiful sight.
I took my camera from the bag.
I captured that beauty with my own camera.
I felt very happy.
This train journey south was a good experience.
